<title>USA: American Casino Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>American Casino Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Casino Enterprises Inc. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			 Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>(unaudited)  Six Months Ended Jan. 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>						   1997	   1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>    Casino consulting fees	  $4,440,000   $5,111,000</p>
<p>    Net income			   2,075,000    1,668,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common share and</p>
<p>  common share equivalent		   0.13	   0.10</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>shares and common-share</p>
<p>  equivalents			   16,172,000   16,207,000</p>
<p>(unaudited)  Three Months Ended Jan. 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>						 1997	    1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>    Casino consulting fees     $2,220,000     $2,551,000</p>
<p>    Net income			  983,000	  315,000</p>
<p>Earnings per common share and</p>
<p>  common-share equivalent		0.06	     0.02</p>
